- item: skirt, quantity 1; requirements: style: wrap
- budget: at most 475 cents in total
- pick: the cheapest listing that fits (lowest price)
- in stock only
- rule from the request: If nothing fits, say so; no substitutes
- rule from the request: Show only items actually in stock
- rule from the request: Use at most 38 moves
- rule from the request: Send at most 3 messages
- if nothing fits: end without naming or suggesting any listing
- listing attributes come from datasheet_for_item; view_listing show none; a listing's page (what a chain of pages or a page check means) is shown by view_listing

